ishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2026-10-25T20:56:58Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T02:51:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":8,"completed":6,"percent_completed":75},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"状态：**Doing / OPEN**。R0–R3已完成；R4累计67/92，第三批#110正在G1输入审计；R5–R7尚未交付。最后核验2026-11-06（Asia/Tokyo）。\n\n- [x] R0 #58：迁移基线、契约、数据和环境\n- [x] R1 #60：应用、认证、SQLx与跨平台基础\n- [x] R2 #67：108/108操作及R2M阶段验收；#61裁决已收口\n- [x] R3 #85：58/58公共HTTP及#97非HTTP/审批/完整阶段集成G4\n- [ ] R4 #101：累计67/92，#102/#106已收口；第三批#110经营与项目收尾25入口及阶段验收进行中\n- [ ] R5：提成全链路，依赖完整R4\n- [ ] R6：迁移/发布接管与回滚演练，依赖R5\n- [ ] R7：统一切换、观察和旧后端退出，依赖R6与正式切换授权\n\n当前Rust正式公开操作累计240；R4累计67/92，余25。完整共享契约293 operations/626 schemas、client616文件；真实producer与完整阶段验收分别认定。\n\n实施提交 [a2995dfb](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/a2995dfb187a70064d2e54ce336a72c24974721a)，归档候选提交 [17c71bac](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/17c71bac90bbeb7686fbdee5c043e58684bcb6b7)；永久S3 4f78bd48保留。[实际验收](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/validation-checkpoint57.md)、[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/g3-independent08.json.bin)、[固定提交](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/fixed-commit09.json.bin)、[main复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/main-integration10.json.bin)、[原字节归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/main/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r4abc/archive-origin-map63.json)。\n\n验收：Rust310通过/54历史ignored，Native74套863项，Angular59套411项；必要写故障59项实命中并完整113表回滚/重试，6锁屏障及跨项目锁负例，Linux同构建续跑链/Windows完整原UI。163早期负例仅有界等价复用，原失败/partial/ignored/Native参考不升格。\n\n清理：1004自有行精确清理，3借用原件恢复；两库113表/各529原seed及catalog/ACL精确恢复、两次noop，2对象86B原字节保留、运行副本0；自有API/浏览器/Native/PG停止，卷/private保留，3作者工作树可恢复归档。\n\n后续仍为R4移交、实际成本40、经营核算/验收完工归档及完整阶段验收，再推进R5–R7。新Rust以业务语义、正确性和合理性为准，不追Node缺陷级对齐。无生产部署、切流或性能结论；总体Issue继续Open。\n\n\n<!-- poms-r4def-g4-current-batch -->\n\nR4DEF本批30入口已完成独立actual G4、线上收口及[Seal主线](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/aaa4b16ac66092f0cb1dc6646a02cf14e80823ee)；[独立证书](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/aaa4b16ac66092f0cb1dc6646a02cf14e80823ee/tools/rust-r4def/independent-final131/g4-final131.json)。只关闭107/108/109/106，101/57保持OPEN，原未完成清单保留。\n\n当前正式Rust240，R4累计67/92、剩25（经营17＋验收/完工/归档8）；完整R4阶段验收、R5–R7、部署切流/性能及S3/真实lost-COMMIT-ACK未被本批认证。\n\n- [x] 既有R2补缺：创建用户携带初始角色/主组织的500已由 [#115](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/115) 修复；真实关联与必要写整体事务、19场景/11故障重试/4锁竞态通过，独立G3/main/归档已完成。\n\n<!-- /poms-r4def-g4-current-batch -->\n\n\n<!-- poms-r4ghi-current-batch -->\n\n2026-11-06：用户授权启动#110，#111 G；#112 H；#113 I；#114 acceptance；并行R2补缺#115。当前仅G0及联合G1输入审计，G2尚未准入。正式Rust240、R4累计67/92，剩25（经营17＋验收/完工/归档8），本批新增正式交付0。完整R4通过阶段验收及独立G3/G4后才可关闭#101；#57保持OPEN。R5有效角色冻结最小依赖在G1按能力复核。\n\n<!-- /poms-r4ghi-current-batch -->\n\n\n<!-- poms-r4ghi-dependencies02 -->\n\n2026-11-06：五项用户业务裁决已明确，见本批 `docs/design/rust-r4ghi/user-decisions02.json`。最小R5角色能力单列 #117（父#116），为#113真实execution准入和#114阶段验收提供producer；不等待完整R5，也不提前认领完整R5。R4候选为原25＋受控stage2＋条件关闭1，另有R5既有4，共32个唯一HTTP待最终canonical/DTO/DDL联合G1复核；既有回款确认语义增补单列受审，不重复计HTTP。正式Rust240、R4既有67/92保持原交付口径，当前新增正式交付0。\n\n角色包允许零权重并说明原因；最终验收对应completed或具可关闭条件的conditional-completed，阶段验收不直接完成项目。当前仍G1准备，产品G2未准入；#101/#57保持Open。\n\n<!-- /poms-r4ghi-dependencies02 -->\n\n\n<details><summary>#115 原始缺陷观察（历史保留）</summary>\n\n```text\n- [ ] 既有R2补缺：`PlatformController_createUser` 带非空 `initialRoleIds` 实际返回500。本批已观察并保留原始 `tmp/rust-r4def/root/api32/00011-PlatformController_createUser.json`：POST `/api/platform/users`，request ID `r4def32-00011-423e6000`，状态500。固定实现[users/service.rs#L469](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/d6c3cff84dd96c981bab075d3f4aca3e98c76c4b/apps/poms-api-rust/src/users/service.rs#L469)的 `has_unbound_children` / intentional Protocol 分支在生成UUID后以 `original user relation has no pre-flush user id` 拒绝并回滚，保留了旧Node/MikroORM缺陷语义。此缺陷在本批不修、未验收修复，不得因R2历史阶段完成而遗漏；后续单独冻结G1，以业务语义、正确性和合理性修复，不追Nodebug等价。\n```\n\n</details>\n\n\n#115限定补缺按独立G4许可收口；实现 [874e35fc](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/874e35fc0af3b6cdf6f6461725eb1343152efbea)、[main与归档](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/commit/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b)；[独立G3](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/tools/rust-r4ghi/independent/userfix-final/g3-review01.json)、[固定提交复核](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/tools/rust-r4ghi/independent/userfix-final/fixed-review01.json)、[原件映射](https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/blob/42b6fc3451eb31042bef80f995c4023eeb6c736b/docs/design/archive/slices/rust-r2-user-create-fix115/origin-map01.json)。 实际线上读回与最终Seal另记。总体#57、R4#101及本批#110、R5#116/#117均保持OPEN，未交付清单保留。\n\n<!-- userfix115-G4-online01 -->\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/57/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/57/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Org